
# runtime dev-server/evidence outputs (never ship)
*.log
# Evidence logs are the exception to the *.log rule above. A log that a document cites has to be in
# the repository or the citation points at nothing; the ones under docs/evidence are committed on
# purpose, scrubbed of paths and account names first. Without this line they were force-added one at
# a time, which is a rule nobody can see and everybody forgets.
!docs/evidence/**/*.log
*.zip
.gradle/
.minecraft-dev*/
bench/deep-archive-*/
bench/deep/
bench/out/
benchmarks/
build/
logs/
run/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
